```mermaid
flowchart TD
Start([Start]) --> Input[/รับ player_Clashscore, enemy_Clashscore,
enemy_hp, player_hp/]
Input --> Calc["damage = max(Bigger Clashscore)"]
Calc --> Reduce["smaller clashscore = opposite = enemy - damage"]
Reduce --> D1{enemy_hp <= 0?}
D1 -->|Yes| Win[/แสดง Victory!/]
D1 -->|No| Show[/แสดง enemy_hp ที่เหลือ/]
Win & Show --> End([End])
```


```mermaid
flowchart TD
Start([Start]) --> XP[/รับ รับ Current xp, xp_needed,
level/]
XP --> |yes| lv[level = level + 1]
lv --> lv2[xp needed = xp_needed x 1.5]
lv2 --> lv3[current_xp = 0]
lv3 & XP --> |No|SH[/แสดง level  และ current_xp/]
SH --> End([end])
```



